<mxCell id="c930" value="• Inspectors never see: Account menu › Admin tools, Inspect + / Edit / print-labels, S15 &amp;#x27;Verify &amp;amp; close&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;Not fixed: send back&amp;#x27; and the admin reassign/priority/due-date panel.&lt;br&gt;• Inspectors CAN: inspect, photograph, submit, start/resolve corrective actions, browse history and captured photos, use Settings and the Safety Assistant, and register new equipment by scanning an&lt;br&gt;unknown code.&lt;br&gt;• Admin routes have no NavHost guard; an inspector simply has no UI entry point to them." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#1e293b;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="g_note927"><mxGeometry x="7.0" y="20.0" width="1046.0" height="59.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
